  "notes": "Personal access tokens (bearer) are generated directly from any Netlify account (including free tier) via Applications > Personal access tokens, no approval needed. OAuth2 is documented as required only for public third-party integrations distributed to other users; direct API use with a PAT is the common self-serve path. Netlify also publishes an official remote/local MCP server (netlify-mcp.netlify.app/mcp and @netlify/mcp npm package) built on the same CLI/API surface.",
